# Route: guide 8 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Troll (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 20 to 26, 87
# quests, 9.1 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (The Barrens, Thunder Bluff): The Crossroads -> Ratchet -> The
# Crossroads -> Lushwater Oasis -> The Crossroads -> The Forgotten Pools ->
# The Crossroads -> The Stagnant Oasis -> The Crossroads -> Lushwater Oasis ->
# The Crossroads -> Grol'dom Farm -> The Sludge Fen -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Trouble at the Docks (959; Mad
# Magglish 18); WANTED: Bruuz (92706; Bruuz 20); Chol'aruk the Ravener (97003;
# Chol'aruk 20); Wrongly Blamed, Justly Corrected (97250; Outraged Pillager
# 23).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Willix the Importer (1144), Blueleaf Tubers (1221),
# Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Deviate Eradication (1487), Deviate Eradication
# (1487), The Glowing Shard (6981), Leaders of the Fang (914), Compendium of
# the Fallen (1049), A Vengeful Fate (1102), Testing an Enemy's Strength
# (5723).

